# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Required because the site uses real paths (/products, /contact, ...)
# rather than hash URLs. Cloudflare Pages does not rewrite unknown paths
# by default, so without this a hard refresh or a directly opened deep
# link 404s -- only / would work.
#
# Static assets are matched and served before this rule, so /favicon.ico,
# /manifest.json, /sitemap.xml and /assets/* still return their real
# content rather than index.html.
#
# This covers Cloudflare Pages; vercel.json covers Vercel.

/*    /index.html   200
